# Play test of Scrapyard Haven (CIPlay scrapyard_haven, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the pier in
# the bay (2.6 m), the town on its terrace (5 m) inside the caravan ring, the gate at its south-west, the scrap pit below
# the ridge (5.5 m), the fortress's deck on the west ridge (18.7 m).
island Scrapyard Haven
expect step 0
expect title King of the Scrapyard

# Up the quay's ladder from the sea, along it into the harbour: the notice, the harbour master's lockbox
climb 43.1 25 h=-1
walk 40 25 to 27 25 to 23 24 h=5
zone harbour
expect step 1
read Harbour notice
expect step 2
open Harbour master's lockbox
expect story gatekey 1
expect step 3

# The gate: shut until the winch hoists it
walk 9.5 21 to 3.8 19.8 to -1 14 h=4 blocked
use winch
expect message rises on its chains
wait 5
expect stand -1 14 h=2.9
expect stand 2.2 16.6 h=3.1
walk 9.5 21 to 3.8 19.8 to -1 14 h=3
zone gate
expect step 4

# Down the shore to the scrap pit: the hyena pack and its alpha
walk -1 14 to -4 9 to -8 -5 to -10 -20 to -9 -31 h=5.5
zone pit
expect message collar of bolts
kill Hyena
expect step 5
expect animals Hyena 0

# Up the ladders to the scrap king's fortress: the hoard on its deck
climb -14.6 -10 h=6.5
climb -14.6 -10 h=13
expect stand -18.5 -10 h=18.7
zone fortress
expect step 6
open Scrap king's hoard
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect done
